<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>VetCare - Accueil</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50 0%, #34495e 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            color: #ecf0f1;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #ecf0f1;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #bdc3c7;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-link {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1.2rem 2.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db 0%, #2980b9 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            min-width: 200px;
        }

        .nav-link.client {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #27ae60 0%, #229954 100%);
        }

        .nav-link.veterinary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c 0%, #c0392b 100%);
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .description {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: rgba(52, 73, 94, 0.5);
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #4a6572;
        }

        .description h3 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #ecf0f1;
        }

        .description p {
            color: #bdc3c7;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">🏥</div>
        <h1>VetCare</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Système de gestion des médicaments et traitements vétérinaires</p>

        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="{{ path('app_client_interface') }}" class="nav-link client">
                👁️ Interface Client
            </a>
            <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="nav-link veterinary">
                🔐 Accès Vétérinaire
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="description">
            <h3>À propos de VetCare</h3>
            <p>
                VetCare est une application web dédiée à la gestion des médicaments et traitements
                dans un cabinet vétérinaire. L'interface client permet la consultation des données
                tandis que l'espace vétérinaire offre des fonctionnalités complètes de gestion.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>